    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the flight management computer and its mounting tray in the flight compartment rack, with the pre and post modification tray items and the database loading module.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "To identify the flight management computer, its mounting tray and the database loading module in the flight compartment rack.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn from the flight compartment looking down into the rack with the access panel removed. Item 20 and item 20A are the deeper and the delivered mounting trays; they are not interchangeable and the deeper tray is required for the larger partition computer at item 10. The database loading module at item 30 is fitted at both standards but is wired to the maintenance connector only where the second load path has been embodied, which the figure shows as a dashed cable run on sheet 2."
    },
